OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for 20 million households in
OL,5,AEngland as he delivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey announces that
OL,8,F20 million households in council tax
OL,9,Fbands A-D in England will receive a
OL,10,F#100 "household energy payment" this
OL,11,Fwinter, as he delivers his first Budget
OL,12,F- watch live above
OL,14,FFunding will be allocated to devolved
OL,15,Fgovernments in Scotland, Wales and
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland to do the same
OL,18,FHealey also says he will extend the VAT
OL,19,Fcut on electricity through the winter
OL,20,Fand spring in an attempt to tackle
OL,21,Frising bills
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
