OL,3,GNEWSAHealey announces #100 energy
OL,4,Apayment for 20 million households in
OL,5,AEngland as he delivers Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FBanks will pay an extra 3% on the banks
OL,8,Fsurcharge, which will be
OL,9,F"time-limited", Healey says - a smaller
OL,10,Ftax rise than expected
OL,12,FThere's a mixed outlook on the economy
OL,13,Ffrom the public finances watchdog -
OL,14,Fwith GDP expected to expand by 1.2%
OL,15,Fthis year, but next year it forecasts
OL,16,F1%, a sharp drop from earlier
OL,17,Fexpectations
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
